            @* Designation decides. The old `UserRole != Dealer` term was MENU-only: PageGuard has
               no Dealer rule for /Dashboard, so a Dealer granted PagePermission.Dashboard could
               always open the route. *@
            @if (LoginState.CanSeeMenu(PagePermission.Dashboard))
            {
                <NavLink class="nav-link"
                         href="/Dashboard"
                         Match="NavLinkMatch.All">

